cff-version: 1.2.0
title: EmbedResearchGaps
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article.
type: software
version: 1.1.1
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/s-matysik/EmbedResearchGaps
abstract: >-
  Embedding-driven identification of candidate research gaps in author-keyword
  space. Two operating modes over the same semantic space: clustering author
  keywords directly, and clustering articles first and then their keywords.
